OL,3,ASeven crew missing after drone attack
OL,4,Aleaves tanker ablaze off Romania's
OL,5,Acoast
OL,6,
OL,7,FSeven of 12 crew members are missing
OL,8,Fafter a drone attack left a chemical
OL,9,Ftanker ablaze off Romania's coast on
OL,10,FThursday morning, naval authorities
OL,11,Fsay.
OL,13,FThe San Marino-flagged Wine Trader was
OL,14,F13 nautical miles (24km) east of the
OL,15,Fmouth of the River Danube at Sulina,
OL,16,Fwhen it reported blasts and a fire.
OL,18,FRomanian President NicuHYor Dan
OL,19,Fconfirmed that the Wine Trader and
OL,20,Fanother chemical tanker in the area,
OL,21,Fthe Yara J, had both been struck by
OL,22,Fdrones - the Yara J on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
